#: ../../source/internal_api_server/internal_api_server.rst:103
msgid "How to extend the Internal API Server"
msgstr "如何扩展内部 API 服务器"

#: ../../source/internal_api_server/internal_api_server.rst:105
msgid ""
"You can extend the ``internal_api_server`` by adding new endpoint files "
"to the `lmcache/v1/internal_api_server/` directory. Ensure your new file "
"name ends with `_api.py`. Additionally, you need to define a `router = "
"APIRouter()` in your file and add your endpoints to it."
msgstr "您可以通过向 `lmcache/v1/internal_api_server/` 目录添加新的端点文件来扩展 ``internal_api_server``。确保您的新文件名以 `_api.py` 结尾。此外，您需要在文件中定义 `router = APIRouter()` 并将您的端点添加到其中。"

